# Horadric Cube recipe 94: magic sash + jewel + rune 07 + perfect emerald -> safety belt
# cubemain row 94: inputs lbl,mag,upg jew r07 gpg -> output usetype,crf. Generated by tools/checks/gen_cube.py
# (specs/world/cube.md §1-§8): ScnCube holds a cube (page 0) and the inputs (page 3)
# from the start; frame 4 opens the cube (0x20 UseGridItem, §1), frame 8 transmutes
# (0x4F ClickButton 0x18, §3). Compared: state + packets (0x9D action 5 per removed
# item, 0x9C action 4 per output, §8).
name cube-094-magic-sash-jewel-rune-07-perfe
save ScnCube --class ama --expansion --item box --item lbl:3/q=magic --item jew:3 --item r07:3 --item gpg:3
seed 1234
ticks 24
seconds 300
channels state packets items
at 4 send UseGridItem item=@1 x=@x y=@y
at 8 send ClickButton button=0x18 p1=0 p2=0
